msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ingestedAtFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "ingestedAt is functional"
msgstr "ingestedAt 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ingestedAtFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:ingestedAt is functional: a gmeow:ImportActivity has a single transaction time — the one instant it recorded its claims into the system — so exactly one xsd:dateTime stamps the activity, keeping the ingest axis distinct from assertion and validity."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:ingestedAt 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:ImportActivity 恰好有一个单一的事务时间——它将其主张记录进系统的那一时刻——因此恰好有一个 xsd:dateTime 为该活动打上时间戳,使摄入轴与断言轴、有效性轴保持区分。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ingestedAtFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the native coherence gate must enforce that gmeow:ingestedAt names exactly one value; this record is the canonical carrier the gate joins, so the obligation is reasoned rather than restated on a shape surface."
msgstr "当原生一致性门必须强制 gmeow:ingestedAt 恰好命名一个值 时使用；该记录是门所连接的规范载体，因此该义务是被推理出来的，而非在形状表面上重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ingestedAtFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid this record when a second value would make the record ambiguous — retire the assertion instead of weakening it, and never mirror it as a hand-authored shape."
msgstr "当第二个值会使该记录产生歧义时避免使用该记录——应撤回该断言而非削弱它，且绝不将其复刻为手写形状。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ingestedAtFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Read together with logic:characteristicSort: the pair (logic:characterizes gmeow:ingestedAt, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) is the whole obligation, and the OWL grounding view projects the matching characteristic from it."
msgstr "与 logic:characteristicSort 一并阅读：(logic:characterizes gmeow:ingestedAt, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) 这一对构成完整义务，OWL 基础视图据此投影出相应特征。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ingestedAtFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:ingestedAtFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:ingestedAt ."
msgstr "gmeow:ingestedAtFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:ingestedAt ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ingestedAtFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Scope: this record carries ONE integrity obligation about gmeow:ingestedAt and nothing else. It is not a definition of gmeow:ingestedAt (that lives on the term itself), not a shape, and not a second place to state the term's meaning — retire the record rather than broaden it."
msgstr "范围：该记录仅承载关于 gmeow:ingestedAt 的一项完整性义务，别无其他。它不是 gmeow:ingestedAt 的定义（定义位于术语自身），不是形状，也不是重述该术语含义的第二处位置——应撤回该记录而非扩大其范围。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/summaryOf|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "summarized source"
msgstr "被概括的源"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/summaryOf|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The identified source information object whose content this Summary condenses."
msgstr "已标识的源信息对象，此 Summary 对其内容进行概括。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/summaryOf|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This optional, nonfunctional relation identifies a particular summarization role within the source lineage. A summary may condense several supplied sources; another derivation input is not automatically a summarized source. The link certifies no fidelity, complete coverage, execution or source-byte identity."
msgstr "此可选、非函数性关系在源的派生沿袭中标识特定的概括角色。摘要可以概括多个已提供的源；其他派生输入不会自动成为被概括的源。此链接不证明忠实性、完整覆盖、执行或源字节的同一性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/summaryOf|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Record ex:summary gmeow:summaryOf ex:division while a retrieval Chunk keeps its actual summary-text carrier through chunkOf."
msgstr "记录 ex:summary gmeow:summaryOf ex:division，同时检索用的 Chunk 通过 chunkOf 保留其实际摘要文本载体。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/summaryOf|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to identify the actual source work, division or other information object whose content a supplied Summary condenses."
msgstr "用于标识已提供的 Summary 所概括内容的实际源作品、结构分部或其他信息对象。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/summaryOf|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid substituting mere topical aboutness, production instructions or the output's retrieval-carrier role for an identified summarized source, inferring the role from every wasDerivedFrom link, or treating generated summary text as a contiguous cut of its original source."
msgstr "避免用单纯的主题关联、生成指令或输出的检索载体角色替代已标识的被概括源，也不要从每个 wasDerivedFrom 链接推断此角色，或将生成的摘要文本视为其原始源中的连续截取。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/summaryOf|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Link the Summary to each identified summarized InformationObject and retain actual source, viewpoint and confidence on the exact assertion. Preserve other actual lineage separately; never invent missing source identities, a unique target, source fidelity or original-source offsets."
msgstr "将 Summary 链接到每个已标识的被概括 InformationObject，并在确切的断言上保留实际源、视点及置信度。分别保留其他实际派生沿袭；切勿编造缺失的源身份、唯一目标、源忠实性或原始源中的偏移量。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/provenanceDigest|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "provenance digest"
msgstr "溯源摘要"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/provenanceDigest|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The supplied SHA-256 digest of the exact identified bytes of the producer-stamped provenance bookkeeping item set aside whole outside the knowledge graph for an Activity record, serving as that record’s pointer to the item while it is retained."
msgstr "来源提供的 SHA-256 摘要，其原像为生产者附于 Activity 记录、随后整体另存于知识图谱之外的溯源记账项的确切已标明字节；在该项仍保留期间，摘要充当记录指向该项的指针。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/provenanceDigest|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This optional, nonfunctional pointer identifies the whole set-aside bookkeeping item rather than its individual leaves. Its preimage is not the Activity record’s own bytes. The relation supplies neither a store location nor a guarantee of retrieval, byte verification or permanent retention."
msgstr "此可选且非函数式的指针标识整体另存的溯源记账项，而非其各个叶级内容。其原像不是 Activity 记录自身的字节。此关系不提供存储位置，也不保证检索、字节验证或永久保留。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/provenanceDigest|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A producer keeps an activity record’s evidence identifiers and contract bookkeeping as one separate item for review; the record retains that item’s supplied SHA-256 pointer instead of asserting each leaf as graph facts."
msgstr "生产者将活动记录的证据标识符和契约记账内容作为一个单独项目保留以供审查；记录保留来源提供的该项 SHA-256 指针，而不将每个叶级内容断言为图谱事实。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/provenanceDigest|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the producer’s provenance bookkeeping is machinery kept elsewhere whole for review, and the Activity record keeps its supplied SHA-256 pointer instead of expanding the bookkeeping into graph facts."
msgstr "用于生产者将溯源记账内容视为机制性资料，整体另存以供审查，而 Activity 记录保留来源提供的 SHA-256 指针、不将记账内容展开为图谱事实时。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/provenanceDigest|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid for the record’s own contentDigest, provenance already stated as facts, a wasDerivedFrom source, another hash algorithm, or an invented encoding, store address or verification claim."
msgstr "避免用于记录自身的 contentDigest、已作为事实陈述的溯源信息、wasDerivedFrom 来源、其他哈希算法，或编造的编码、存储地址或验证声明。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/provenanceDigest|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep the supplied xsd:hexBinary literal on the Activity as exactly 64 bare lowercase hexadecimal digits. Preserve source attribution and identification of the separate item and its actual bytes; do not retype the literal, infer an encoding, or claim that the item was retrieved or its digest checked."
msgstr "在 Activity 上保留来源提供的 xsd:hexBinary 字面量，其词法形式须为恰好 64 个无前缀的小写十六进制数字。保留来源归属，以及单独项目和其实际字节的标识；不得改变字面量类型、推断编码，或声称已检索该项或校验其摘要。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ProvenanceDigestLexicalConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Provenance digest lexical constraint"
msgstr "溯源摘要词法约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ProvenanceDigestLexicalConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every supplied provenanceDigest has exactly 64 bare lowercase hexadecimal digits; its provided-value range independently requires xsd:hexBinary. SHA-256 is fixed by the property’s meaning, not inferred from arbitrary hexadecimal values."
msgstr "每个来源提供的 provenanceDigest 均须包含恰好 64 个无前缀的小写十六进制数字；提供值的范围校验另行要求 xsd:hexBinary。SHA-256 由属性含义固定，不是从任意十六进制值推断而来。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ProvenanceDigestLexicalConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This is supplied-value syntax admission. It computes no hash and certifies neither the item’s bytes, agreement with its reported digest, retrieval nor retention. No missing pointer is invented and no other digest representation is substituted."
msgstr "此约束只校验来源提供值的语法。它不计算哈希，也不认证该项字节、字节与所报告摘要的一致性、检索或保留。不会编造缺失指针，也不会替换成其他摘要表示。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ProvenanceDigestLexicalConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A supplied pointer with an algorithm prefix or uppercase hexadecimal fails this lexical contract even when the source labels it SHA-256."
msgstr "来源提供的指针若含算法前缀或大写十六进制数字，即使来源标注其为 SHA-256，也不符合此词法契约。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ProvenanceDigestLexicalConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to validate the exact lowercase hexadecimal spelling of each supplied provenanceDigest without changing its literal identity."
msgstr "用于校验每个来源提供的 provenanceDigest 的确切小写十六进制拼写，不改变其字面量身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ProvenanceDigestLexicalConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating lexical acceptance as verified SHA-256 agreement, accepting a generic digest fallback, normalizing invalid input or requiring a pointer on every Activity."
msgstr "避免将词法通过视为已验证 SHA-256 一致性、接受通用摘要回退、规范化无效输入，或要求每个 Activity 都有指针。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ProvenanceDigestLexicalConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Apply the canonical positive provenanceDigest guard and the exact pattern ^[0-9a-f]{64}$ to its supplied value. Combine this lexical obligation with the property’s provided-value Activity and xsd:hexBinary checks; reject failures without retyping or replacing the source value."
msgstr "通过规范的正向 provenanceDigest 守卫，将确切模式 ^[0-9a-f]{64}$ 应用于来源提供的值。结合属性的 Activity 和 xsd:hexBinary 提供值校验履行此词法要求；对失败予以拒绝，不改变类型或替换来源值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ProvenanceDigestLexicalConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/message"
msgid "Every supplied provenanceDigest has exactly 64 bare lowercase hexadecimal digits; its provided-value range independently requires xsd:hexBinary. SHA-256 is fixed by the property’s meaning, not inferred from arbitrary hexadecimal values."
msgstr "每个来源提供的 provenanceDigest 均须包含恰好 64 个无前缀的小写十六进制数字；提供值的范围校验另行要求 xsd:hexBinary。SHA-256 由属性含义固定，不是从任意十六进制值推断而来。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Approval|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Approval"
msgstr "批准"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Approval|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A reified record that a named agent approved a body of work on a given day. It mediates between the approver (gmeow:approvedBy) and the body of work approved (gmeow:approvalOf), carries the calendar day (gmeow:approvedOn), and may carry the part of the work approved (gmeow:approvalScope) and the agent who put the approval on record (gmeow:reportedBy). Approving a body of work is a different fact from holding the claims in it: an approver is not thereby a holder of those claims, an author, a contributor or a source, and the record asserts neither that the work is correct nor that the approver agrees with every part of it."
msgstr "一条具体化的记录，表明某个具名主体在某一天批准了一项工作成果。它在批准者（gmeow:approvedBy）与被批准的工作成果（gmeow:approvalOf）之间起中介作用，携带日历日期（gmeow:approvedOn），并可携带被批准的部分（gmeow:approvalScope）以及将该批准录入记录的主体（gmeow:reportedBy）。批准一项工作成果与持有其中的主张是两个不同的事实：批准者并不因此成为这些主张的持有者、作者、贡献者或来源，且该记录既不断言该工作成果正确，也不断言批准者认同其每一部分。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Approval|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "One Approval node records one approval by one approver of one body of work. A joint approval is several Approval nodes, and a later approval is a new node. The identifier and label of an existing Approval are never changed or reused, and a correction or a re-approval adds a new node instead of rewriting an earlier one. This is a usage contract: no axiom enforces it and no gate can detect a relabelled node. The approver, the approved work and the approval day are required paths, closed-world on gmeow:Approval, so a node that omits any of them is rejected; nothing in the record says the approval is still current."
msgstr "一个 Approval 节点记录一位批准者对一项工作成果的一次批准。联合批准对应多个 Approval 节点，后续批准则是新节点。既有 Approval 的标识符与标签绝不更改或重用；更正或重新批准应添加新节点，而不是改写先前的节点。这是一项使用约定：没有任何公理强制它，也没有任何门能检测出被改名的节点。批准者、被批准的工作成果和批准日期是必填路径，在 gmeow:Approval 上按封闭世界处理，因此省略其中任何一项的节点会被拒绝；记录中没有任何内容表明该批准仍然有效。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Approval|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:approval1 a gmeow:Approval ; gmeow:approvalOf ex:handbook ; gmeow:approvedBy ex:drOkafor ; gmeow:approvedOn \"2026-11-05\"^^xsd:date ; gmeow:approvalScope ex:handbookChapter3 ."
msgstr "ex:approval1 a gmeow:Approval ; gmeow:approvalOf ex:handbook ; gmeow:approvedBy ex:drOkafor ; gmeow:approvedOn \"2026-11-05\"^^xsd:date ; gmeow:approvalScope ex:handbookChapter3 ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Approval|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid it for signed or policy-bound vouching, which is gmeow:Attestation (a vouching act under a named policy, with a required issue instant); for authorizing an effect before it is dispatched, which is logic:ApprovalCommitment (bound to an exact intent, operator, policy, decision and validity window); and for credit for making the work, which is gmeow:Contribution. Avoid it to say whose frame holds a claim (gmeow:accordingTo) or who is responsible for the work (gmeow:wasAttributedTo), and avoid treating an approver as a holder because an Approval names them."
msgstr "避免用于带签名或受策略约束的担保，那属于 gmeow:Attestation（在具名策略下的担保行为，带有必需的签发时刻）；避免用于在效果被派发之前对其授权，那属于 logic:ApprovalCommitment（绑定于确切的意图、操作者、策略、决定和有效期窗口）；避免用于对制作该工作成果的署名，那属于 gmeow:Contribution。避免用它表示某个主张在谁的框架下成立（gmeow:accordingTo）或谁对该工作成果负责（gmeow:wasAttributedTo），也避免因 Approval 点名了批准者就将其视为持有者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Approval|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Mint one Approval per approval and bind gmeow:approvalOf, gmeow:approvedBy and gmeow:approvedOn. Add gmeow:approvalScope only when the approval covers a stated part of the work, and gmeow:reportedBy when the party who recorded the approval is worth naming. For a later approval or a correction add a new node and leave earlier nodes untouched. Keep any claims the approver holds on their own standpoint-indexed statements, separate from the Approval."
msgstr "每次批准创建一个 Approval，并绑定 gmeow:approvalOf、gmeow:approvedBy 和 gmeow:approvedOn。仅当批准覆盖工作成果的某个明确部分时才添加 gmeow:approvalScope；当录入该批准的一方值得点名时才添加 gmeow:reportedBy。对于后续批准或更正，添加新节点，保持先前节点不变。批准者所持有的任何主张应保留在其各自按立场索引的陈述上，与 Approval 分开。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Approval|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to record who approved a body of work, on which day, and optionally for which part of it, as a fact kept apart from who holds the claims in the work."
msgstr "用于记录谁在哪一天批准了一项工作成果，并可选地记录批准了其中哪一部分，作为与谁持有该工作成果中的主张相分离的事实。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/approvalOf|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "approval of"
msgstr "批准对象"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/approvalOf|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Relates an Approval to the body of work it approves. It is the second role of the Approval relator, which needs an approved work as well as an approver; without it an approval would not be about anything. A single Approval approves one body of work, and approval of several works is several Approval nodes."
msgstr "将一个 Approval 关联到其所批准的工作成果。它是 Approval 关系体的第二个角色，因为关系体既需要批准者，也需要被批准的工作成果；没有它，批准就不涉及任何对象。一个 Approval 只批准一项工作成果，批准多项工作成果则对应多个 Approval 节点。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/approvalOf|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:approval1 gmeow:approvalOf ex:handbook ."
msgstr "ex:approval1 gmeow:approvalOf ex:handbook ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/approvalOf|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid it for the part of the work that was approved (use gmeow:approvalScope) and for the agent who approved (use gmeow:approvedBy); naming a work here does not make the approver a holder of its claims."
msgstr "避免用于被批准的那一部分（应使用 gmeow:approvalScope）和批准的主体（应使用 gmeow:approvedBy）；在此处点名某项工作成果并不使批准者成为其主张的持有者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/approvalOf|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Point the gmeow:Approval at the body of work the approval concerns, whether a creative work, an information object or another entity; narrow the approval to a part with gmeow:approvalScope, not by pointing here at the part."
msgstr "让 Approval 指向该批准所涉及的工作成果，无论它是创作作品、信息对象还是其他实体；要将批准缩小到某个部分，应使用 gmeow:approvalScope，而不是在此处指向该部分。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/approvalOf|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to name the body of work that an Approval approves."
msgstr "用于指明一个 Approval 所批准的工作成果。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/approvalScope|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "approval scope"
msgstr "批准范围"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/approvalScope|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Relates an Approval to a part of the approved work that the approval covers: a component reached by gmeow:partOf, or a citation selector for a pinpoint. It is optional and may repeat, so one Approval can name several parts. When it is absent the scope is unstated; that never means the whole work was approved."
msgstr "将一个 Approval 关联到该批准所覆盖的、被批准工作成果的某个部分：可以是通过 gmeow:partOf 到达的组成部分，也可以是用于精确定位的引文选择器。它是可选的且可重复出现，因此一个 Approval 可以点名多个部分。缺失时，范围即为未说明；这绝不意味着整项工作成果都已获批准。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/approvalScope|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:approval1 gmeow:approvalScope ex:handbookChapter3 ."
msgstr "ex:approval1 gmeow:approvalScope ex:handbookChapter3 ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/approvalScope|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid it for the body of work the approval concerns (that is gmeow:approvalOf), and avoid reading a missing value as approval of everything; also avoid it for a time window, which is not a part of a work."
msgstr "避免用于该批准所涉及的工作成果（那是 gmeow:approvalOf），也避免将缺失的值解读为批准了一切；同样避免用于时间窗口，因为时间窗口不是工作成果的一部分。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/approvalScope|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Point at each approved part, or at a citation selector when only a pinpoint is covered; leave it off when the scope was not stated rather than naming the body of work the approval concerns."
msgstr "指向每个被批准的部分；若仅覆盖精确定位，则指向引文选择器；当范围未说明时应省略，而不是点名该批准所涉及的工作成果。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/approvalScope|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to say which part of a body of work an Approval covers when the approval is narrower than the work."
msgstr "当批准的范围窄于整项工作成果时，用于说明一个 Approval 覆盖工作成果的哪一部分。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/approvedBy|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "approved by"
msgstr "批准者"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/approvedBy|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Relates an Approval to the person or agent who approved the body of work. An approver is not thereby a holder of the work's claims, an author or a contributor: this property is deliberately not a subproperty of gmeow:accordingTo, gmeow:vantage, gmeow:wasAttributedTo, gmeow:wasAssociatedWith or any contributor property, so that holding claims and approving a work stay separate facts, both expressible."
msgstr "将一个 Approval 关联到批准该工作成果的人或主体。批准者并不因此成为该工作成果主张的持有者，也不是作者或贡献者：此属性刻意不是 gmeow:accordingTo、gmeow:vantage、gmeow:wasAttributedTo、gmeow:wasAssociatedWith 或任何贡献者属性的子属性，使持有主张与批准工作成果保持为两个独立的事实，二者皆可表达。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/approvedBy|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:approval1 gmeow:approvedBy ex:drOkafor ."
msgstr "ex:approval1 gmeow:approvedBy ex:drOkafor ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/approvedBy|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid it to say whose frame holds a claim (use gmeow:accordingTo), who is responsible for the work (use gmeow:wasAttributedTo), who is credited for making it (use a gmeow:Contribution) or who recorded the approval (use gmeow:reportedBy)."
msgstr "避免用于表示某个主张在谁的框架下成立（应使用 gmeow:accordingTo）、谁对该工作成果负责（应使用 gmeow:wasAttributedTo）、谁因制作它而获得署名（应使用 gmeow:Contribution）或谁录入了该批准（应使用 gmeow:reportedBy）。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/approvedBy|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Set one gmeow:Agent on each Approval; for a joint approval mint one Approval per approver. Do not infer holding of the work's claims, authorship or endorsement of every part from it."
msgstr "在每个 Approval 上设置一个 gmeow:Agent；联合批准时，为每位批准者创建一个 Approval。不要据此推断其持有该工作成果的主张、署名作者身份，或认同其每一部分。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/approvedBy|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to name the person or agent who approved a body of work in an Approval."
msgstr "用于在 Approval 中指明批准某项工作成果的人或主体。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/approvedOn|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "approved on"
msgstr "批准日期"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/approvedOn|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The calendar day on which an Approval was given, typed as xsd:date. It is a day, not an instant: no time of day and no midnight is invented for it."
msgstr "一个 Approval 被给出的日历日，类型为 xsd:date。它是一个日期而非时刻：不会虚构具体时间，也不会虚构午夜。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/approvedOn|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:approval1 gmeow:approvedOn \"2026-11-05\"^^xsd:date ."
msgstr "ex:approval1 gmeow:approvedOn \"2026-11-05\"^^xsd:date ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/approvedOn|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid it for the instant of a signed vouching act (use gmeow:issuedAt on a gmeow:Attestation), for when the system learned of the approval (gmeow:ingestedAt or gmeow:recordedAt) and for a validity window; avoid padding a day to a date-time."
msgstr "避免用于带签名的担保行为的时刻（应在 gmeow:Attestation 上使用 gmeow:issuedAt）、系统获知该批准的时间（gmeow:ingestedAt 或 gmeow:recordedAt）以及有效期窗口；避免将日期补足为日期时间。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/approvedOn|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Attach one xsd:date literal to the gmeow:Approval; a different day is a different approval and so a new node."
msgstr "为 Approval 附加一个 xsd:date 字面量；不同的日期即是不同的批准，因此是新节点。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/approvedOn|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to record the day an approval was given when only the date is known or meant."
msgstr "当只知道或只需要日期时，用于记录批准被给出的那一天。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reportedBy|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "reported by"
msgstr "报告者"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reportedBy|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Relates an Approval to the agent who put the approval on record. The reporter only recorded it: they need not be the approver, and reporting makes them neither responsible for the approved work nor a holder of its claims. It differs from gmeow:wasAttributedTo, which ascribes responsibility (authorship, ownership or accountability) for an entity to an agent, and from gmeow:approvedBy, which names who gave the approval. It is optional, may repeat, and is not a subproperty of anything."
msgstr "将一个 Approval 关联到将该批准录入记录的主体。报告者只是记录了它：不必是批准者，且报告并不使其对被批准的工作成果负责，也不使其成为其中主张的持有者。它不同于 gmeow:wasAttributedTo（后者将实体的责任——作者身份、所有权或问责——归于某个主体），也不同于 gmeow:approvedBy（后者指明谁给出了批准）。它是可选的、可重复出现的，且不是任何属性的子属性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reportedBy|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:approval1 gmeow:reportedBy ex:registryClerk ."
msgstr "ex:approval1 gmeow:reportedBy ex:registryClerk ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reportedBy|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid it for the agent who gave the approval (use gmeow:approvedBy), for responsibility for the Approval or the work (use gmeow:wasAttributedTo) and for the party who ran an import (use gmeow:wasAssociatedWith on the gmeow:ImportActivity)."
msgstr "避免用于给出批准的主体（应使用 gmeow:approvedBy）、对 Approval 或工作成果的责任（应使用 gmeow:wasAttributedTo）以及执行导入的一方（应在 gmeow:ImportActivity 上使用 gmeow:wasAssociatedWith）。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reportedBy|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Set it on the gmeow:Approval for each agent who reported the approval; several reporters may coexist. Omit it when the recorder is unknown."
msgstr "在 Approval 上为每个报告了该批准的主体设置它；可以并存多个报告者。当录入者未知时应省略。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reportedBy|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to name who put an approval on record when that party differs from the approver."
msgstr "当录入批准的一方不同于批准者时，用于指明谁将批准录入了记录。"
